  {
   "id": 1143,
   "hub_id": 13634,
   "version": "1.5.1",
   "description": "<h3>This version will only work with SPT 3.11.x</h3>\n<p>Tracking can now be done at the objective level, useful for tasks that span multiple maps (Such as Shooter Born in Heaven)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tracking an objective will automatically track the parent quest</li>\n<li>Untracking the last tracked objective on a quest will untrack the parent quest</li>\n<li>If no specific objectives are tracked, all objectives are shown in the quest tracker</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note that this update will clear any previously tracked quests, as the structure of the tracking file has changed</p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1140/quest-tracker/1.5.1",
